<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>THE REGOLITH JAR</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #000000;
    --ink: #ffffff;
    --muted: rgba(226, 230, 245, 0.68);
    --dim: rgba(200, 206, 230, 0.44);
    --gold: #d8b45a;
    --violet: #9d7bff;
    --blue: #7fb0ff;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  #sky { animation: skydrift 240s linear infinite; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  
  main { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .wrap { width: min(1000px, 88vw); margin: 0 auto; }

  nav.top {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 30; height: 54px;
    display: flex; align-items: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    background: rgba(10, 15, 26, 0.66);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
  }
  nav.top .wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  nav.top .brand { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .34em; color: var(--dim); }
  nav.top a.back { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; }
  nav.top a.back:hover { color: var(--ink); }

  section { padding: 110px 0; }
  .hero { padding: 170px 0 120px; text-align: center; }
  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5.8vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 200;
    letter-spacing: .16em;
    line-height: 1.16;
  }
  .hero .cap { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); letter-spacing: .22em; }

  .stage {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.05fr);
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 58px 52px;
    border-radius: 26px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    margin-bottom: 46px;
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(18, 24, 40, 0.86), rgba(10, 14, 24, 0.82));
  }
  .stage.rev { direction: rtl; }
  .stage.rev > * { direction: ltr; }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .3em;
    color: var(--violet);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .stage h2 {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.3vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: .01em;
  }
  .stage p {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .stage ul { margin-top: 22px; list-style: none; }
  .stage li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 10px 0 10px 18px;
    position: relative;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .stage li:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .stage li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; top: 19px;
    width: 5px; height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(157, 123, 255, .8);
  }
  .stage li b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

  .art {
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 28% 22%, rgba(157,123,255,.14), transparent 56%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 76% 80%, rgba(127,176,255,.12), transparent 58%),
      rgba(255,255,255,.02);
  }
  .art img.shot {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: top center;
    display: block;
  }
  .art .badge { z-index: 2; }
  .art .ghost {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: .24em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.20);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 22px;
    line-height: 2.1;
  }
  .art .badge {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 16px; left: 16px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: .2em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.34);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; padding: 36px 24px; }
    .stage.rev { direction: ltr; }
    .art { order: -1; }
    section { padding: 76px 0; }
  }
@keyframes skydrift { from { transform: translate3d(0,0,0) } to { transform: translate3d(-3%, 1.2%, 0) } }
</style>
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<div id="sky"><canvas id="skyCanvas"></canvas></div>
<nav class="top"><div class="wrap"><span class="brand">THE REGOLITH JAR</span><a class="back" href="/">回到首页</a></div></nav>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <h1>THE REGOLITH JAR</h1>
      <div class="cap">2026</div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="stage">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">欢迎页</div>
          <h2>实时星空与标题动效</h2>
          <p>整站背景是一块全屏 canvas，星点由随机分布在三维空间中的粒子投影到二维平面生成，随鼠标轻微位移产生视差。粒子数量按屏幕面积换算，移动端自动减半。</p>
          <ul>
            <li><b>滚动视差</b>：星层按深度分三层，滚动时位移速度不同</li>
            <li><b>低开销</b>：粒子上限固定，`requestAnimationFrame` 在页面不可见时挂起</li>
            <li><b>标题动效</b>：主标题逐字淡入，字距从 .34em 收拢到 .16em，单次播放不循环</li>
            <li><b>金印</b>：logo 为静态位图，只在悬停时放大 1.03 倍</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="art"><img class="shot" src="/images/portfolio/trj-welcome.jpg" alt="欢迎页 页面截图"><span class="badge">欢迎页</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage rev">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">自习室</div>
          <h2>音乐、计时、待办</h2>
          <p>页面中央是三张纵向排列的卡片，左侧固定，右侧内容区随卡片滚动。所有状态写入 `localStorage`，刷新后保留。</p>
          <ul>
            <li><b>自习音乐</b>：内置曲库 + <b>支持导入自己播放器的歌单</b>（外链解析，不转存音频文件）</li>
            <li><b>同房间同步收听</b>：房主切换曲目时，房间内其他成员同步跳转，进度对齐误差控制在 1 秒内</li>
            <li><b>番茄钟 / 正计时</b>：25 分钟专注与 5 分钟休息可改，正计时用于不预设时长的场景，到点触发浏览器通知与提示音</li>
            <li><b>待办清单</b>：回车新增、勾选完成，存本地；支持拖动排序</li>
            <li><b>自习室列表</b>：`socket.io` 长连接，显示在线人数与各自累计时长，离开自动下线</li>
            <li><b>IP 拉黑</b>：房主可将指定 IP 移出房间，被拉黑后重连仍会被拒</li>
            <li><b>全屏单机模式</b>：断开 socket，仅保留本地计时与待办，适合网络不稳时使用</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="art"><img class="shot" src="/images/portfolio/trj-study.jpg" alt="自习室 页面截图"><span class="badge">自习室</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">情绪页</div>
          <h2>记录与放松</h2>
          <p>六张卡片，数据全部保存在浏览器本地，不上传服务器。除情绪记录外，其余均为无状态的即时交互。</p>
          <ul>
            <li><b>情绪速记</b>：十二个表情，点击写入当天记录，同一日期可覆盖，支持一键清空</li>
            <li><b>呼吸练习</b>：圆形按 4 秒吸气、7 秒屏息、8 秒呼气的节奏缩放，可暂停</li>
            <li><b>环境声音</b>：雨、风、火堆三段循环音轨，独立音量</li>
            <li><b>每日记录</b>：单行文本输入，按日期归档</li>
            <li><b>解压游戏</b>：点击消除类小游戏，无计分无存档</li>
            <li><b>放松一下</b>：随机展示一张图片与一句短语</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="art"><img class="shot" src="/images/portfolio/trj-mood.jpg" alt="情绪页 页面截图"><span class="badge">情绪页</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage rev">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">3D 星空模型</div>
          <h2>可交互的星球</h2>
          <p>独立于背景星空的第二层 3D 场景，用 Three.js 渲染。模型可拖拽旋转、滚轮缩放，光源固定在右上，材质为无贴图的纯色 PBR。</p>
          <ul>
            <li><b>旋转与缩放</b>：鼠标拖动改变方位角与俯仰角，滚轮调整相机距离，边界值有钳制</li>
            <li><b>渲染开销</b>：几何体面数控制在 2 万以内，关闭阴影，`renderer.setPixelRatio` 上限为 2</li>
            <li><b>进入视口才渲染</b>：用 `IntersectionObserver` 判断，离开视口停止 `requestAnimationFrame`</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="art"><img class="shot" src="/images/portfolio/trj-starmap.jpg" alt="3D 星空 页面截图"><span class="badge">3D 星空</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="stage">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">作品卡片</div>
          <h2>Cover Flow 卡片带</h2>
          <p>页面左侧的一条横向卡片带，采用 Cover Flow 布局：中间卡片正面朝向镜头，两侧按距离递减缩放、增加旋转角与不透明度衰减。</p>
          <ul>
            <li><b>拖拽滑动</b>：鼠标或触屏拖动，松手按惯性回弹到最近一张</li>
            <li><b>键盘操作</b>：左右方向键切换，`Enter` 打开当前卡片</li>
            <li><b>跳转</b>：带 `data-url` 的卡片可点击，其余停在原地</li>
            <li><b>移动端</b>：卡片宽度与间距按视口宽度计算，保留 3D 纵深</li>
            <li><b>当前项目</b>：THE REGOLITH JAR、Pico RamOS、巷、猫径 CatWay、OC 小工具、月壤箱</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="art"><img class="shot" src="/images/portfolio/trj-works.jpg" alt="作品 页面截图"><span class="badge">作品</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>

<script>
(function () {
  var canvas = document.getElementById('skyCanvas');
  if (!canvas) return;
  var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d', { alpha: true });
  var w = 0, h = 0, dpr = 1;
  /* ---------- star field: the same 3-D projection the homepage uses ----------
   * The catalogue stores RA in hours; createStarfieldScene already handles the
   * sphere mapping, colour by magnitude and slow rotation, so the intro and the
   * landing page show the identical sky instead of a flat equirectangular one. */
  function fallbackStars() {
    var out = [];
    for (var i = 0; i < 900; i++) {
      out.push([Math.random() * 24, Math.random() * 180 - 90, 1 + Math.random() * 5, 0]);
    }
    return out;
  }

  function bootSky() {
    if (typeof THREE === 'undefined') { setTimeout(bootSky, 120); return; }
    fetch('/data/stars.json').then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
      .catch(function () { return fallbackStars(); })
      .then(function (catalog) {
        try { createStarfieldScene('sky', catalog); }
        catch (e) { console.warn('starfield failed', e); }
      });
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'complete') bootSky();
  else window.addEventListener('load', bootSky);



function createStarfieldScene(containerId, starData) {
                const container = document.getElementById(containerId);
                if (!container) {
                    console.warn(`Container #${containerId} not found`);
                    return null;
                }

                const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
                canvas.style.display = 'block';
                canvas.style.width = '100%';
                canvas.style.height = '100%';
                container.appendChild(canvas);

                const width = container.clientWidth;
                const height = container.clientHeight;
                canvas.width = width;
                canvas.height = height;

                const scene = new THREE.Scene();
                const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, width / height, 0.1, 1000);
                camera.position.set(0, 0, 0);

                const starGroup = new THREE.Group();
                const positions = [];
                const colors = [];

                const processedStars = starData.map(star => ({
                    ra: (star[0] * 15) * deg2rad,
                    dec: star[1] * deg2rad,
                    mag: star[2],
                    bv: star[3] || 0.5
                }));

                for (let i = 0; i < processedStars.length; i++) {
                    positions.push(0, 0, 0);
                    colors.push(1, 1, 1);
                }

                const geometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();
                geometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(positions, 3));
                geometry.setAttribute('color', new THREE.Float32BufferAttribute(colors, 3));

                const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({
                    size: 1.0,
                    vertexColors: true,
                    blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending,
                    depthWrite: false,
                    sizeAttenuation: true,
                    transparent: true
                });

                const points = new THREE.Points(geometry, material);
                starGroup.add(points);
                scene.add(starGroup);

                // 手机 GPU 扛不住全屏 antialias + 高 DPR 像素量，降配
                const smallScreen = window.innerWidth <= 768;
                const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: false, antialias: !smallScreen });
                renderer.setSize(width, height);
                renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, smallScreen ? 1.5 : 2));
                renderer.setClearColor(0x050510, 1.0);

                let rafId = null, running = false, io = null;
                let lastSkyUpdate = 0;
                const SKY_INTERVAL = 250; // ms：天文位置 4Hz 足够，肉眼不可辨
                function animate() {
                    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(animate);

                    const now = new Date();
                    // 天空 16ms 只转约 0.0004°——原来每帧对每颗星重算 GMST+三角函数
                    // 再全量重传 GPU 缓冲，3 个场景同时跑，手机直接被拖垮。
                    // 节流到 4Hz：没到间隔就什么都不做（画布保留上一帧，天空本就静止）。
                    if (now.getTime() - lastSkyUpdate < SKY_INTERVAL) return;
                    lastSkyUpdate = now.getTime();

                    const positionsArray = geometry.attributes.position.array;
                    const colorsArray = geometry.attributes.color.array;

                    for (let i = 0; i < processedStars.length; i++) {
                        const star = processedStars[i];
                        const coord = raDecToAltAz(star.ra * rad2deg, star.dec * rad2deg, now, longitude, latitude);
                        const altRad = coord.alt * deg2rad;
                        const azRad = coord.az * deg2rad;

                        const r = 500;
                        const x = r * Math.cos(altRad) * Math.sin(azRad);
                        const y = r * Math.sin(altRad);
                        const z = r * Math.cos(altRad) * Math.cos(azRad);

                        positionsArray[i*3] = x;
                        positionsArray[i*3+1] = y;
                        positionsArray[i*3+2] = z;
                        const brightness = Math.pow(2.5, -star.mag) * 200;
                        let rCol, gCol, bCol;
                        if (star.bv < 0) {
                            rCol = 0.6; gCol = 0.8; bCol = 1.0;
                        } else if (star.bv < 0.6) {
                            rCol = 1.0; gCol = 1.0; bCol = 1.0;
                        } else if (star.bv < 1.2) {
                            rCol = 1.0; gCol = 0.9; bCol = 0.7;
                        } else {
                            rCol = 1.0; gCol = 0.6; bCol = 0.4;
                        }
                        colorsArray[i*3] = rCol * brightness;
                        colorsArray[i*3+1] = gCol * brightness;
                        colorsArray[i*3+2] = bCol * brightness;
                    }

                    geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;
                    geometry.attributes.color.needsUpdate = true;

                    renderer.render(scene, camera);
                }
                function startLoop() { if (running) return; running = true; lastSkyUpdate = 0; animate(); }
                function stopLoop() { running = false; if (rafId) { cancelAnimationFrame(rafId); rafId = null; } }
                // 3 个星空场景同时常驻 rAF 太奢侈：只有划到眼前的页面才跑，
                // 划走就停（浏览器对后台标签页本身就会停 rAF，无需额外处理）
                if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
                    io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
                        if (entries.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) startLoop();
                        else stopLoop();
                    }, { threshold: 0.01 });
                    io.observe(container);
                } else {
                    startLoop();
                }

                const resizeHandler = () => {
                    const newWidth = container.clientWidth;
                    const newHeight = container.clientHeight;
                    canvas.width = newWidth;
                    canvas.height = newHeight;
                    camera.aspect = newWidth / newHeight;
                    camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
                    renderer.setSize(newWidth, newHeight);
                };
                window.addEventListener('resize', resizeHandler);

                return () => {
                    window.removeEventListener('resize', resizeHandler);
                    stopLoop();
                    if (io) io.disconnect();
                    renderer.dispose();
                };
            }
</script>
</body>
</html>
